<%# ☰ is U+2630, not emoji, so it takes the row's text colour and weight. %>
<%# aria-hidden: dragging has no keyboard equivalent, and announcing a control
    a screen reader user cannot operate is worse than announcing nothing. %>
<span data-handle class="mt-1 shrink-0 cursor-grab touch-none select-none px-1 text-lg opacity-40"
      aria-hidden="true">☰</span>
